== Description ==

'''Simple Motor''' is an electronic component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Electronics Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Rotor]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Rotating Blade]], [[Rotating Circular Saw]], [[Sensor Spike]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

